<title>FRANCE: Pechiney sells 37.7 pct stake in Carbone.</title>
<headline>Pechiney sells 37.7 pct stake in Carbone.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pechiney said on Wednesday it had sold its remaining 37.7 percent stake its Carbone Lorraine through a private placement with institutonal investors in France and abroad.</p>
<p>The sale of the 727,042 shares was made at 1,310 francs per share and will result in a net capital gain of about 500 million francs in the 1997 consolidated accounts, Pechiney said in a statement.</p>
<p>It will also allow Pechiney to reduce debt by a little over 900 million francs, it said.</p>
</text>
